1
00:00:01,501 --> 00:00:03,181
Previously on
The Big Bang Theory...

2
00:00:03,254 --> 00:00:04,114
Hey, Stuart.

3
00:00:04,115 --> 00:00:04,875
What are you doing here?

4
00:00:04,901 --> 00:00:06,581
Oh, I'm living here again.

5
00:00:06,584 --> 00:00:09,884
Do, uh, Howard
and Bernadette know?

6
00:00:09,887 --> 00:00:13,427
Or is it like a possum
in the walls kind of thing?

7
00:00:14,258 --> 00:00:17,058
No. I needed
a place to stay,

8
00:00:17,061 --> 00:00:18,291
and with the baby coming,

9
00:00:18,295 --> 00:00:20,265
I figured they could
use some extra help.

10
00:00:20,264 --> 00:00:22,594
Hey, tomorrow, who wants
to paint the nursery?

11
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:23,630
I'll do it.

12
00:00:23,629 --> 00:00:25,429
Why do you get to do it?
I'm the artist.

13
00:00:25,703 --> 00:00:28,703
Just because you're starving
doesn't make you an artist.

14
00:00:28,706 --> 00:00:32,036
Just because I look sickly
doesn't mean I'm starving.

15
00:00:32,042 --> 00:00:34,172
Howard?

16
00:00:34,178 --> 00:00:36,348
I think I'm in labor.

17
00:00:36,347 --> 00:00:38,317
Oh. Oh, okay. Okay.

18
00:00:38,315 --> 00:00:40,215
Uh, uh, uh,
I can do this.

19
00:00:40,217 --> 00:00:41,647
We have a plan.

20
00:00:41,652 --> 00:00:43,522
Somebody please
tell me the plan!

21
00:00:43,520 --> 00:00:45,050
I'll get the
hospital bag.

22
00:00:45,055 --> 00:00:45,765
I'll pull the van up.

23
00:00:45,789 --> 00:00:46,889
Meet you outside
in two minutes.

24
00:00:46,891 --> 00:00:49,361
Team Baby, go!

25
00:00:52,263 --> 00:00:53,833
Oh, man.

26
00:00:53,831 --> 00:00:55,301
(Howard:)This is really
happening.

27
00:00:55,299 --> 00:00:56,999
(Howard:)You doin' okay?

28
00:00:57,001 --> 00:00:58,601
(Bernadette:)Here comes another contraction.

29
00:00:58,602 --> 00:00:59,972
Let's pick it up!

30
00:00:59,970 --> 00:01:01,440
(Raj:)All right, hold on.

31
00:01:01,438 --> 00:01:03,268
(Raj:)I'm gonna drive
like we do in India.

32
00:01:03,274 --> 00:01:07,944
(Raj:)Get out of my way,
you syphilitic dogs!

33
00:01:09,313 --> 00:01:11,043
Stop that!
This isn't India.

34
00:01:11,064 --> 00:01:11,984
(Raj:)Fine.

35
00:01:11,982 --> 00:01:16,882
(Raj:)What do one point three billion
people know about having babies?

36
00:01:16,887 --> 00:01:19,387
(Howard:)Sorry. I know you were just
trying to help.

37
00:01:20,090 --> 00:01:21,360
(Howard:)I love you.

38
00:01:21,358 --> 00:01:23,988
(Raj:)I love you, too.
We're good.

39
00:01:23,994 --> 00:01:27,634
♪ Our whole universe
was in a hot, dense state ♪

